System.ShowElementNames_DESC_OSX.target:
While item names are shown, either say a name to click an item, or say another command that references a name to perform an action at the item’s location.
To prevent item names from disappearing after each command, say “{System.ShowElementNamesContinuously}” or select the Item Names Overlay option in Voice Control settings. To make item names disappear, say “{System.HideElementNames}”.
{RemoteURLRef.UsingOverlays}

System.ShowLabels_DESC_OSX.target:
While item numbers are shown, either say a number to press an item, or say another command that references a number to perform an action at the item’s location.
To prevent item numbers from disappearing after each command, say “{System.ShowElementNumbersContinuously}” or select the Item Numbers Overlay option in Voice Control settings. To make item numbers disappear, say “{System.HideLabels}”.
{RemoteURLRef.UsingOverlays}

System.ShowElementNumbersContinuously_DE.target:
While item numbers are shown, either say a number to press an item, or say another command that references a number to perform an action at the item’s location.
When you show item numbers continuously, the Overlay option in Voice Control settings is set to Item Numbers. To stop showing item numbers, say “{System.HideLabels}”. When you do, the Overlay option in Voice Control settings is set to None.
{RemoteURLRef.UsingOverlays}

System.ShowGrid_DESC_OSX.target:
While the numbered grid is shown, either say a number to drill into the grid further, or say another command that references a number to perform an action at that location.
To prevent the numbered grid from disappearing after each command, say “{System.ShowGridNumbersContinuously}” or select the Numbered Grid Overlay option in Voice Control settings. To display a numbered grid only over the active window, say “{System.ShowActiveWindowGrid}”. To make the numbered grid disappear, say “{System.HideGrid}”.
{RemoteURLRef.UsingOverlays}

System.ShowGridNumbersContinuously_DESC_.target:
While the numbered grid is shown, either say a number to drill into the grid further, or say another command that references a number to perform an action at that location.
When you show the grid continuously, the Overlay option in Voice Control settings is set to Numbered Grid. To stop showing the numbered grid, say “{System.HideGrid}”. When you do, the Overlay option in Voice Control settings is set to None.
{RemoteURLRef.UsingOverlays}
